export anchor IndigoNightStyle:
    number: 288
    screen: CodeRepository
    name: Indigo night
    idea: A soft deep-indigo workspace with a left repository sidebar and floating 16px cards, led by a merge readiness panel that gathers the twelve check pills, the two reviewers and the locked merge button, lit only by soft blue and purple.
    base: dark
    palette:
        abyss: #12132a, the page background, the sidebar and the diff code area
        deep: #1b1d3c, cards and the style sheet cards
        dusk: #262a55, the current sidebar item, chips, the hunk header and the disabled merge button
        edge: #383c72, card borders and dividers
        starlight: #eceefe, text
        lilac: #b3b8e3, meta, labels and line numbers
        blue: #8fb4ff, links, the primary button and focus
        purple: #b79cff, the current sidebar bar, section icons and the hero glow
        mint: #7ee0b0, passed, approved, Open and added lines
        honey: #ffcf7a, requested changes
        coral: #ff8fa3, failing and removed lines
        addTint: #1b3036, added line rows
        delTint: #3a2140, removed line rows
    type:
        One sans stack, Inter, Segoe UI Variable, Segoe UI, system-ui, Roboto, base
        15px on 1.55. Title 30px at 650, card titles 18px at 600, sidebar items 14px
        at 500, meta 13px. Code 13px ui-monospace on 1.65.
    layout:
        Two columns at full height. A 264px abyss sidebar holds the B mark and
        Brightwork Code, the owner and repository name with a Private chip, three
        small stat tiles for Watch 12, Star 48 and Fork 3, and the six tabs as a
        vertical list with counts, Pull requests current with a dusk fill and a
        purple left bar. The main column, max 1000px, starts with a hero card with a
        soft purple glow at one corner, the number 214, the title, the Open chip and
        merge sentence, and a ruled property row for assignees, labels, milestone
        and linked issue. Next a merge readiness card with three blocks side by
        side, twelve check pills with the failing one hollow and named, the two
        reviewers as avatar rows with verdicts, and the disabled merge button with
        its reason. Then three file cards in a row, each with its path, counts and a
        split bar, and the diff card with the inline comment. Below 1000px the
        sidebar becomes a top block with the tabs as a wrapping row and the
        readiness blocks stack.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 28px card padding, 24px between cards, 32px main padding.
    density: Low. Big soft cards, plenty of air.
    corners: Very soft. 16px cards, 12px stat tiles and buttons, 999px chips and check pills, round avatars.
    borders: 1px edge borders on cards. The current sidebar item has a 3px purple left bar.
    shadows:
        Large soft shadows, 0 12px 32px at 45 percent black, and a blurred purple
        glow behind the hero corner.
    icons:
        Rounded line icons at 1.75px stroke at 1.15em, section icons in purple.
        Check circle for passed and approved, crossed square for failing, triangle
        with a bang for requested changes, padlock for the blocked merge.
    focus: A 2px blue outline offset 3px.
    tone: Gentle and helpful, such as Merge readiness and Waiting on 1 check.
